<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendices</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In <a href="#Ax1.SS1" title="A Training Details ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a>, we present the training details of our main results. In <a href="#Ax1.SS2" title="B Pseudocode ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a>, we present the pseudocode of our DeBias-CLIP method. In <a href="#Ax1.SS3" title="C Additional Ablations ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a>, we present additional ablations, including on the embedding stretching for SigLIP, training length, sampling, padding, and token padding methods. In <a href="#Ax1.SS4" title="D Additional Discussion on CLIP Biases ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> and <a href="#Ax1.SS5" title="E Additional Discussion on Long-CLIP Biases ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E</span></a>, we present additional discussion and results on CLIP and Long-CLIP biases, respectively. In <a href="#Ax1.SS6" title="F Visualizations and Results for Image Generation ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Sec.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">F</span></a>, we present visualizations that highlight the superior long-text retrieval capabilities of DeBias-CLIP and demonstrate its advantages in text-to-image diffusion.</p>
</div>
<section id="Ax1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A </span>Training Details</h3>

<div id="Ax1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Complete training parameters are provided in <a href="#Ax1.T6" title="In A Training Details ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>. Our setup largely follows Long-CLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">56</a>]</cite>, with two modifications: we train for 3 epochs instead of only 1 and use a smaller batch size of 256 instead of 1024 to ensure consistency across all experimental runs. Experiments were conducted on a variety of hardware configurations, subject to compute cluster availability, but the main results in Sec. <a href="#S5.SS3" title="5.3 Results ‣ 5 Experiments and Results ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.3</span></a> of the paper were all run on 4 A100 GPUs.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Ax1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<table id="Ax1.T6.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Parameter</th>
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Value</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Batch size</th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t">256</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">Training epochs</th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">3</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">Warm-up iterations</th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">200</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">Weight decay</th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1e-2</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">Learning rate</th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">1e-6</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">AdamW <math id="Ax1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{1}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.9</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.8" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row">AdamW <math id="Ax1.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">0.999</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T6.3.9" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T6.3.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">AdamW <math id="Ax1.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<td id="Ax1.T6.3.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">1e-8</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Ax1.T6.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="Ax1.T6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Training parameters<span id="Ax1.T6.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. We use AdamW as the optimizer and run on 4 A100 GPUs for the main paper results.
</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B </span>Pseudocode</h3>

<div id="Ax1.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present pseudocode of our sampling method in <a href="#alg1" title="In B Pseudocode ‣ Appendices ‣ CLIP Is Shortsighted: Paying Attention Beyond the First Sentence" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, where <math id="Ax1.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\varphi\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\varphi\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math> is the text tokenizer, <math id="Ax1.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{\mathrm{text}}\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>text</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{\mathrm{text}}\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="Ax1.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\psi_{\mathrm{img}}\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mi>img</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\psi_{\mathrm{img}}\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math> are respectively the text and image encoders, and <math id="Ax1.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f\left(\cdot\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f\left(\cdot\right)</annotation></semantics></math> is an operator that reconstructs feature vectors from their principal components (PCA).</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> DeBias-CLIP Caption Sampling</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_align_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
            Long-text caption <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=[s_{1},s_{2},\dots,s_{n_{\text{sents}}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sents</mtext></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=[s_{1},s_{2},\dots,s_{n_{\text{sents}}}]</annotation></semantics></math>, image <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math>, loss weight <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\lambda^{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>λ</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\lambda^{s}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
            Training loss <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\ell}\leftarrow C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\ell}\leftarrow C</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l3.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Long caption
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\ell}\leftarrow\varphi(C^{\ell})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\ell}\leftarrow\varphi(C^{\ell})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right; float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Tokenize long caption
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\text{no\_sum}}\leftarrow[s_{2},\dots,s_{n_{\text{sents}}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mtext>no_sum</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sents</mtext></msub></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\text{no\_sum}}\leftarrow[s_{2},\dots,s_{n_{\text{sents}}}]</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Remove first (summary) sentence
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
            Sample <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{samp}}\sim\mathcal{U}\{1,\dots,n_{\text{sents}}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sents</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{samp}}\sim\mathcal{U}\{1,\dots,n_{\text{sents}}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
            Sample a subset <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}\subset\{2,\dots,n_{\text{sents}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sents</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}\subset\{2,\dots,n_{\text{sents}}\}</annotation></semantics></math> with <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{S}|=n_{\text{samp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{S}|=n_{\text{samp}}</annotation></semantics></math> (without replacement)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l8.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">8:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow</annotation></semantics></math> concatenate <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{s_{i}:i\in\mathcal{S}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒮</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{s_{i}:i\in\mathcal{S}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l9.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">9:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow\varphi(C^{\text{samp}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow\varphi(C^{\text{samp}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Tokenize short caption
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l10.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">10:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow[\mathtt{SOT},t_{1},\dots,t_{n_{samp}},\mathtt{EOT},\mathtt{PAD}_{\text{post}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝚂𝙾𝚃</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝙴𝙾𝚃</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝙿𝙰𝙳</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\text{samp}}\leftarrow[\mathtt{SOT},t_{1},\dots,t_{n_{samp}},\mathtt{EOT},\mathtt{PAD}_{\text{post}}]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l11.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">11:</span></span>
              
              
            Let <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{post}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{post}}</annotation></semantics></math> be the number of post-padding tokens in the tokenized short caption <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{\text{samp}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>T</mi><mtext>samp</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{\text{samp}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l12.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">12:</span></span>
              
              
            Sample <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{pre}}\sim\mathcal{U}\{0,\dots,n_{\text{post}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>pre</mtext></msub><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒰</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{pre}}\sim\mathcal{U}\{0,\dots,n_{\text{post}}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l13.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">13:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{post}}\leftarrow n_{\text{post}}-n_{\text{pre}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>pre</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{post}}\leftarrow n_{\text{post}}-n_{\text{pre}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l14.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">14:</span></span>
              
              
            <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T^{s}\leftarrow[\mathtt{SOT},\underbrace{\mathtt{PAD},\dots,\mathtt{PAD}}_{n_{\text{pre}}},t_{1},\dots,t_{n_{samp}},\mathtt{EOT},\underbrace{\mathtt{PAD},\dots,\mathtt{PAD}}_{n_{\text{post}}}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>𝚂𝙾𝚃</mi><mo>,</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>𝙿𝙰𝙳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝙿𝙰𝙳</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>pre</mtext></msub></munder><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>m</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>𝙴𝙾𝚃</mi><mo>,</mo><munder><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>𝙿𝙰𝙳</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝙿𝙰𝙳</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="true">⏟</mo></munder><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub></munder></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T^{s}\leftarrow[\mathtt{SOT},\underbrace{\mathtt{PAD},\dots,\mathtt{PAD}}_{n_{\text{pre}}},t_{1},\dots,t_{n_{samp}},\mathtt{EOT},\underbrace{\mathtt{PAD},\dots,\mathtt{PAD}}_{n_{\text{post}}}]</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l15.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">15:</span></span>
              
              
            Encode captions and image:

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l16.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">16:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{s}\leftarrow\psi_{\text{text}}(T^{s})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mi>s</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{s}\leftarrow\psi_{\text{text}}(T^{s})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l16.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right; float:right;"><math id="alg1.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Short (sampled) caption
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l17.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">17:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{\ell}\leftarrow\psi_{\text{text}}(T^{\ell})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mtext>text</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msup><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{\ell}\leftarrow\psi_{\text{text}}(T^{\ell})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l17.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right; float:right;"><math id="alg1.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Long caption
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
