<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="Ax1.T7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 7</span>: </span><span id="Ax1.T7.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Ablation on stretching all embeddings of SigLIP models for text-to-image (T2I) retrieval<span id="Ax1.T7.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. While performance on long retrieval (see Urban1k and DOCCI) does not change substantially, stretching all the embeddings leads to a significant reduction in short-text retrieval performance (see COCO and Flickr).
</span></span></figcaption>
